I'll update the compliance service to follow the existing codebase approach, using HTTPException to communicate duplicate entry constraints effectively. The goal is a consistent, user-friendly error management strategy across different backend services.

The modifications will focus on standardizing how unique constraints and conflict scenarios are handled, mirroring patterns already established in other service implementations.

